       (Convert: Celsius double -> Fahrenheit string; ConvertBack: Fahrenheit
       string -> Celsius double, invariant culture both ways), declare it as a
       resource, and bind a TextBox named FahrenheitBox through it, two-way,
       to Celsius:
         <UserControl.Resources>
           <b:Ex015_CelsiusToFahrenheitConverter x:Key="C2F" />
         </UserControl.Resources>
         <TextBox Name="FahrenheitBox"
                  Text="{CompiledBinding Celsius, Mode=TwoWay, Converter={StaticResource C2F}}" />
       A converter that only implements Convert and throws (or no-ops) in
       ConvertBack passes a test that checks display only - the test here also
       types into the box and asserts the view model's Celsius afterward, so
       both directions must actually work. -->
